  "originalText": "                                                                                               14 February 2023\n                                                                                              ESMA22-106-4405\n\n\n\n\nSecurities and Markets Stakeholder Group\n\n\n\nAdvice to ESMA\nSMSG advice to ESMA on potential practical challenges regarding the implementation\nof the Digital Operational Resilience Act\n\n\n1 Executive Summary\nOn December 14, 2022, the EU co-legislators formally adopted the Digital Operational\nResilience Act (DORA), consisting of a regulation (Regulation (EU 2022/2554, DORA-R) and\na directive (Directive (EU) 2022/2556, DORA-D), which came into effect on January 16, 2023.\nDORA reflects the key role of information and communication technology (ICT) for the\nprovision of fina",
